# Gateway external canary needs operator action

This scheduled beat is the independent alarm for the Telegram external delivery
canary. The gateway does not dispatch it.

Read the run named in the prompt from
`~/.joelclaw/receipts/gateway-external-delivery-canary.jsonl`. Confirm the same
run in OTEL with component `gateway-external-canary` and action
`gateway.external_canary.failed`.

Report the failed path, terminal evidence, oldest unhandled external input age,
and overdue aggregate deadlines. Ask Joel for operator action. Do not send a
live canary. Do not start a poller or listener. Do not start, restart,
reconfigure, or repair the gateway or transport.

This lane is a receipt reader. It has no repair authority.
